0-4857-9940-f9f5c4820047.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk56/seasons/52b49f28-3f72-46b5-bb72-9665925f51c3.jpg","likes":12,"dislikes":0,"views":2027,"release_date":"1459641600000","season_number":96,"description":"U.C. 0096...\r\n\r\nThe manufacturing colony Industrial 7, which is still under construction, floats at Lagrange point 1.\r\n\r\nA youth named Banagher Links, who grew up without knowing his father, meets a mysterious girl who has stowed away on a ship bound for Industrial 7. As the white mobile suit Unicorn undergoes repeated tests and becomes the subject of diverse speculations, the hands of time begin to move.\r\n\r\nBy the year 0096 of the Universal Century, a fragile peace emerges from the ashes of conflict. Sixteen-year-old student Banagher Links visits the Industrial 7 space colony on a school field trip, but because of a broken shuttle, he is left completely stranded.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.3}],"value":8.3,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":5229,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}